                                                Dijkstra's Algorithm




1. Find the cheapest node, you can get to in lease amount of time
2. Update the cost of neighbours of this node
3. Repeat until youve done this for every node in graph
4. Calculat the final path

:An undirected edge means both the connected nodes point at each other

shortest path in unweighted graphs: BFS
shortest path in weighted graphs: Dijkstra 

